    {
      "id": "ari:cloud:trello::card/workspace/6a9807517a71aa833c5dedb8/6aa5565746ee8953de105288",
      "name": "Alert developers when an in-game purchase is completed",
      "description": "## Goal\n\nSend a real-time Discord notification whenever a verified in-game purchase succeeds in **BACKROOMS: STAY QUIET**.\n\n## Destination\n\nUse a **private developer-only channel** in the game/community Discord server, suggested name: `#dev-purchase-alerts`. Regular players and community members must not be able to see the channel or notifications. Only approved developer/admin roles should have access.\n\n## Alert contents\n\n- Product name and ID\n- Actual Robux paid\n- Player username and user ID\n- Timestamp\n- Purchase ID for deduplication\n- Server/place ID when useful\n\nExample:\n\n> 💰 NEW PURCHASE\n> Product: Emergency Re-entry\n> Price: 25 Robux\n> Player: ExamplePlayer (123456)\n> Time: 14:32 UTC\n\n## Security and reliability\n\n- Trigger only from the server after Roblox verification through the existing `MarketplaceService.ProcessReceipt` flow.\n- Never use `PromptProductPurchaseFinished` as proof of payment.\n- Preserve existing receipt granting and permanent deduplication.\n- Never expose the Discord webhook URL to clients. Prefer a secure external relay/endpoint.\n- Notification delivery must be separate and best-effort: Discord failure must never delay or reject the player's grant.\n- Deduplicate notifications by `PurchaseId` when Roblox retries receipts.\n- Do not transmit unnecessary personal information.\n- Rate-limit requests and never log webhook secrets.\n\n## Done when\n\n- One successful test purchase creates exactly one private Discord alert.\n- The alert contains the correct product, amount, player and time.\n- Community members cannot access the channel.\n- Discord failure does not affect the purchase grant.\n- Receipt retry creates no duplicate alert.\n- Test evidence and implementation are documented before publishing.",
      "url": "https://trello.com/c/XuxYAtTA/69-alert-developers-when-an-in-game-purchase-is-completed",
      "shortUrl": "https://trello.com/c/XuxYAtTA",
